sequenceDiagram
 participant A as Job 1
 participant K as Kernel / CPU
 participant D as Device
 A->>K: Request I/O
 K->>D: Start transfer
 Note over K,D: Another ready job can run during transfer
 D-->>K: Completion interrupt
 K->>K: Handle completion and mark Job 1 ready
 K-->>A: Resume Job 1 when dispatched
